  mText: "Block Strike personalizes your advertising experience using Appodeal. Appodeal and its partners may collect and process personal data such as device identifiers, location data, and demographic and interest data to provide other advertising experience tailored to you.\n\nBlock Strike uses the device's email address as the player's ID in the game.\n\nBlock Strike collects statistics and analyzes your personal data in the game using the AppMetrica service. AppMetrica collects and analyzes personal data such as device identifiers, location data, information about the device, error data, and demographic data.\n\nBy agreeing, you confirm that you are over the age of 16 and would like a personalized ad experience, use email as an identifier in the game and agree to the analysis and collection of your personal data in the game.\n\nPlease accept our full privacy policy to find out what personal data we collect and how to use them."
